Changelog: 15-11-2026 04:09:59

Breaking. BC-250 SFTP Tools has its own id, bc250-sftp-tools, for the launcher, the menu entry, the settings and the
data folders (owner, 15-11-2026). It does not take over a copy installed before: uninstall that one first.
